 is a muscle relaxant."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le03ob09aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "anti-inflammatory"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a medication that helps to reduce inflammation"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need an anti-inflammatory."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le03ob09aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "slipped disc "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a condition when the tissue around the spine is torn "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Sounds like you have a slipped disc."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le03ob09aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tensor bandage"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a tight bandage wrapped around a swollen part of the body"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Can you tell me where I can find a tensor bandage?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le03ob09aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to sprain "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to twist the ligaments of an ankle or wrist causing swelling and pain"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The tensor bandage is for a friend who sprained her thumb."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le03ob09aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Asking for Help"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can use the modal verbs <span class=\"strong\">can</span> or <span class=\"strong\">could</span> to ask for help. <span class=\"strong\">Could</span> is more polite than <span class=\"strong\">can</span>.  "}, {"type": "text", "content": "The structure is: <br/>Can/Could + you + show/tell+ me+ Question word (who, what, where, when, why, which, how) <br> "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":5,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Can/Could\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" you\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" show/tell\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" me\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Question word\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Could \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" you \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" tell\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" me \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> what</span> dosage I need?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Can\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" you\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" show\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" me\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> how</span> to use this?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Could\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" you\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" show\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" me\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">where</span> I can find a tensor bandage? \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Can\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" you\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" tell\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" me\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> which</span> pain medication I should use?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you want to offer help, or when someone offers help, you can use the structure:<br/>Let me show/tell + you + question word"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Let me show you what dosage you need.<br/>Let me show you where it is.</span><br/><span class=\"italic\">Let me tell you what you should do.</span>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Giving Advice "}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the modals <span class=\"italic\"> should</span>, <span class=\"italic\"> ought to</span>, and <span class=\"italic\"> had better</span> to give advice. You can also use the second conditional. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"> Should</span> is the most common modal used to give advice.  <span class=\"italic\"> <br/>Ought to</span> and <span class=\"italic\"> had better</span>  are used for giving strong advice."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Modal\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Main Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"       \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" You\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" should\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"get \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"some help for the pain.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" You\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" ought to \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" take\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"these and lie down right away.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" had better not\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" drive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"while taking this medication.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" would\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" go\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to the doctor if it doesn't get better soon.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "In conversation, it is common to use contractions with <span class=\"italic\">had better</span>:<br/><span class=\"italic\">You'd better not step on the line.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use the second conditional to give advice. This sounds more friendly and conversational. It is common to use the condition </br><span class=\"italic\">If I were you, ... </span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "If I were you, I'd take this medication twice a day."}, {"type": "example", "content": "If it doesn't get better soon, you should go to the doctor. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I wouldn't take more than the recommended dose if you don't want to feel worse."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn7le03ob09re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Imagine you are at the pharmacy."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a dialogue between you and the pharmacist."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Create a health problem and ask the pharmacist for help."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice your dialogue with your partner."}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write about health a problem."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about health care."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I ask for help with my health problem."}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"questions": [], "img_path