", "id": 0, "image": "engenn7le03ob09re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Pharmacist</span>: Hello. How may I help you?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: \t\tHi. Can you show me which pain medication I should use?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Pharmacist</span>: \t\tOk, what is the issue, exactly?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: \t\tI've injured my back. I have intense pain and stiffness. I've tried a heat pack and a cold pack, neither of which worked. I'm having a lot of trouble walking.", "id": 1, "image": "engenn7le03ob09re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "21400", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Pharmacist</span>: \t\tOk, sounds like you may have a slipped disk. There isn't much you can do to heal it. If I were you, I'd take this medication twice a day. It's a  muscle relaxant and anti-inflammatory. It should help with the pain. Let me show you what dosage you need. Here, on the package. I wouldn't take more than the recommended dose if you don't want to feel worse. It is strong medication.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn7le03ob09re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "47000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: \t\tOk, so that's it? Just take this and lie down?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Pharmacist</span>: \t\tUnfortunately, that's all you can do. If it doesn't get better soon, you should go to the doctor. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: \tOk, thanks. One last thing. Can you tell me where I can find a tensor bandage? It's for a friend who sprained her thumb.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Pharmacist</span>: \t\tOf course, right over here.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le03ob09re2img02.jpg"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le03ob09re2img05.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": [], "title": ""}], "id": 0}]}